<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">About the community</p>
    <h1>Security that keeps pace with autonomy.</h1>
    <p>Cloud Security Corner is an open community focused on a fast-growing security problem: AI agents can use credentials, call tools, access sensitive data, and change cloud infrastructure.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="container narrow prose">
    <h2>Our mission</h2>
    <p>We make agentic cloud security practical. We create and curate guidance for identity, authorization, tool isolation, runtime defense, threat modeling, evaluations, governance, and incident response.</p>
    <h2>Who we bring together</h2>
    <p>Security practitioners, cloud engineers, AI builders, and governance teams collaborate to develop controls that keep autonomous systems useful, observable, and bounded.</p>
    <h2>Contribute</h2>
    <p>Help improve a lab, add a tool, or share a field note. Start with the <a href="https://github.com/CloudSecCorner/cloudseccorner.github.io/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md">contribution guide</a> or join the <a href="https://discord.gg/aUD4hkYYGt">community Discord</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
